msgid ""
"Every live number on this site — price, TVL, transaction volume, balances"
" — is computed directly from the XRP Ledger. We do not source any metric "
"from third-party analytics APIs (Bithomp, xrpl.to, XPMarket, DefiLlama, "
"etc.). Their products are good — but if we wrapped them for our data, "
"we'd just be a thinner version of their work. Account display labels are "
"a separate concern (see \"Reference labels\" below) — there, XRPSCAN's "
"public well-known list is one of several sources we layer onto on-ledger "
"identifiers."
msgstr ""

