msgid "Signed integrity snapshots"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Every UTC day we publish a cryptographically signed snapshot of headline "
"metrics — ledger index, AMM pool count and TVL, MPT count, named-accounts"
" count — chained into an append-only Merkle tree and signed with our "
"Ed25519 key. Anyone can fetch any past snapshot, verify the signature "
"against our published public key, and prove the number was attested by us"
" on the recorded date. No other XRPL dashboard publishes verifiable "
"historical data."
msgstr ""

msgid "Our signing key fingerprint:"
msgstr ""

msgid "not yet published."
msgstr "لم يُنشر بعد."

msgid ""
"The same fingerprint is pinned on <a href=\"/methodology#signed-"
"snapshots\">/methodology</a> and in DNS TXT <code>_xrpld-snapshot-"
"key.xrpldashboard.com</code>. All three sources must agree — if any one "
"of them is altered without the others, the discrepancy is the alarm. Full"
" public key at <a href=\"/.well-known/snapshots/pubkey.pem\">/.well-"
"known/snapshots/pubkey.pem</a>; verification form at <a "
"href=\"/snapshots/verify\">/snapshots/verify</a>; daily snapshot index at"
" <a href=\"/snapshots/\">/snapshots/</a>."
msgstr ""

