msgid ""
"we surface that a Credential exists, what type code it carries, and "
"whether the Subject has accepted it. We do not (and will not) try to "
"fetch the off-chain content of a Credential. The URI typically points to "
"IPFS or an issuer-controlled document — whether the claim is honest, "
"current, and meaningful is between the Issuer, the Subject, and whoever "
"chooses to trust them. The dashboard reports what the ledger says, not "
"what the underlying document means."
