"<code>6578616D706C652E636F6D</code>. Most signing tools (Xaman/Xumm, "
"GemWallet, xrpl-py, xrpl.js) accept the domain as a plain string and hex-"
"encode it for you. The protocol stores it as hex; the human-readable form"
" is just a presentation detail."
